From 8187b417d88b4ce72644730bc8732bf24cbc7077 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: g1-door <g1-door@local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:07:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] door: state-input student for stage 2.5 (DAgger without
 vision)

- DoorStateSensor: door angle as measured by the head LiDAR (10 Hz, 0.1 s latency, noise, per-episode bias,
  dropout when the panel is seen edge-on or the hand is near it), door frame pose from map + localization
  (position/yaw bias and noise), tape-measured door geometry (no weight). Own torch.Generator.
- door_open_homie: new obs terms door_angle_lidar / door_frame_loc / door_geometry; mirror also teacher_obs
  (DAgger teacher sees the mirrored world it was trained on)
- StateRecurrentActorObjPred: VisionRecurrentActorObjPred without the vision encoder
- configs: obs door_open_homie_29dof_state_dagger, exp door_open_homie_29dof_state_dagger-lstm
  (robot/rewards/env copied from the teacher exp)
---
